/E (Moiz Hashmi's talk chronicles his and his friends' journey of building an AI B2B SaaS startup, Factful, during high school. His lessons learned include the importance of moving fast vs. being correct, the power of a good story, and that distribution may matter more than the product itself. Ultimately, it provides a great insider, behind-the-scenes look at what it takes to build and grow a startup from the ground up!)
